== Local technical materials inspected August 19, 2026

*VERIFIED (local inspection).* The technical descriptions were prepared from separately scoped artifacts
reviewed by the submitter: guarded-commitment and candidate-result formal
models; exact pure-Rust categorical, observation-accumulator, batch, and
degree-one through degree-three B-spline kernels; separate Lean proof modules;
one narrow Verus-checked transfer seam; focused local-Agave/SBF construction,
custody, point-resolution, redemption, reservation, staged-resolution,
submission, and settlement campaigns;
and a deterministic synthetic-transcript leakage laboratory. The SBF evidence
includes a genesis-assisted 22-transaction signed sequential categorical
custody walk, ordinary-wallet blank-bank construction,
source-receipt-authenticated native point resolution with internal and
exact-lot bearer redemption, one measured staged prepaid resolution route
admitted under the selected compute-headroom profile, one measured full-width
candidate submission with full top-three selection a measured rollback STOP,
and one restricted same-page full-fill single-claim zero-fee
settlement slice. None composes into a complete venue or reporting system.
The bounded Clear energy-dispatch relation and the encrypted
candidate-validation experiment described in the body are deterministic
research artifacts in separately provenanced repositories.

Local resolution authenticates one canonical, sealed, program-owned
single-page source receipt and refuses same-domain substitutions;
permissionless source construction executes only in a deliberately
non-production mock-provider build, and the default build registers no
provider or parser release and fails closed before source state or value
admission. *STOP:* no production provider authenticator, parser, or
deployable source pipeline exists; authenticated production price history
remains a qualifying design, not a current SBF property. Shielded concealment
of individual batch orders is also proposed,
not a property of the transparent batch prototype. The Clear, Shielded, and
Dark taxonomy is a proposed analytical distinction, not a claim of any
deployed confidential system. The bounded TFHE experiment supplies input
confidentiality against the evaluation-key holder for one
candidate-validation predicate; no composed Clear, Shielded, or Dark venue
exists in the submitter's research.
A final public edition should cite frozen public repository commits and exact
paths if those repositories are public by filing time; otherwise it should
retain this limited description and avoid claims of independent public
reproducibility.

